── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────── E0100_javascript_function.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt declares a function with `fn`, not `function`:

  1 │ function add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │ ^^^^^^^^

A function is `fn`, its name, its parameters with their types, and `->` and its
result type.

To fix it, write `fn`:

  1 │ fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │ ~~
